{"scene_id": "s01348", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01348.fountain", "heading": "EXT. THE GLASSMAKERS' STAIRCASE - DAWN", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ILSE MARROW", "names": ["ILSE MARROW", "ILSE"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 1, "name": "WYNNE ASHCROFT", "names": ["WYNNE ASHCROFT", "WYNNE"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 6}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. THE GLASSMAKERS' STAIRCASE - DAWN", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A staircase cut into a cliff of black obsidian, spiraling up toward a cloud-wrapped citadel.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Each step is a slab of blown glass, translucent green, filled with drifting bubbles.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Below, a mist-choked valley.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Above, nothing.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "ILSE MARROW, 30s, climbs with a glass lantern slung from her pack, the glow shifting violet in the cold.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Her cloak is the color of dried lavender; her boots are taped at the heel; a long scar runs along her jaw.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Three steps behind her follows WYNNE ASHCROFT, 30s, pale and spare, with a crooked staff of white ash and the patient eyes of someone who has outlasted several wars.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They said it would take a day.", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They said a lot of things about the stair.", "name": "WYNNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It sings.", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It does that when it wants to be crossed.", "name": "WYNNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Under Ilse's boot, a step chimes like a crystal glass.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "She pauses.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Wynne pauses.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "A bubble drifts through the glass and bursts.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Did she come this way?", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She came this way.", "name": "WYNNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Did she come back?", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She didn't say.", "name": "WYNNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Ilse climbs again.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The stair rings with each step, a soft cascade of notes.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "The sky above lightens.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Clouds tear.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "A flock of silver birds pours across the gap.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Wynne. You do not have to follow.", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "WYNNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She is your sister.", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She is your mother.", "name": "WYNNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Ilse stops.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The next stair is cracked down the middle.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Beneath it, the valley yawns.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "She places her foot on it.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "It holds.", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we are both followers.", "name": "ILSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Wynne smiles.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "She taps the staff against the glass, and the whole stair hums like a harp, once, twice, a third time.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}